    <details class="method"><summary>How this is computed</summary>
      <p>Everything but "Base stat" assumes <strong>max Speed investment</strong> at level 50: 32 <abbr class="term" tabindex="0" data-tip="Champions' replacement for EVs: 66 points per Pokémon, at most 32 in one stat, with IVs fixed at 31.">Stat Points</abbr> (of 66 in total), a beneficial <abbr class="term" tabindex="0" data-tip="What Champions and the official team sheets call a nature.">Stat Alignment</abbr>, and IVs, which are fixed at 31. That's a convention, not data: tournament team sheets don't publish the Stat Points teams actually run.</p>
    </details>
